import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const w=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 757 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Deduction and Anchoring of New Laws","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 757 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Deduction and Anchoring of New Laws","no":757,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules","New-Law Deduction","Law Anchoring","Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm","Deduction-Iteration System"],"related":["11-Deduction-Iteration System Details","24-Anchor Energy-Conduction Path","20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0757_模块4-超多元级规则-新法则推演与锚定.md","filePath":"en/0757_模块4-超多元级规则-新法则推演与锚定.md"}'),o={name:"en/0757_模块4-超多元级规则-新法则推演与锚定.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-757-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-deduction-and-anchoring-of-new-laws" tabindex="-1">Entry 757 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Deduction and Anchoring of New Laws <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-757-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-deduction-and-anchoring-of-new-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 757 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Deduction and Anchoring of New Laws&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 11, 24, 20</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-discovering-a-new-law-is-equal-to-adding-a-new-part-to-the-cosmos" tabindex="-1">Introduction: discovering a new law is equal to adding a new part to the cosmos <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-discovering-a-new-law-is-equal-to-adding-a-new-part-to-the-cosmos" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: discovering a new law is equal to adding a new part to the cosmos&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivator, through the Deduction-Iteration System, discovers a new law not previously encoded, he faces not &quot;now I know it&quot; and done, but two engineering problems: <strong>first, how to confirm this new law is real and self-consistent? Second, how to &quot;anchor&quot; this new law into the existing law network, letting it run stably rather than drift away?</strong> This is the new-law deduction and anchoring engineering.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are deduction and anchoring&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires new laws serve increment; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires new laws be consented by Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires new laws serve uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires new-law introduction not disturb old causality; the law-first axiom requires new laws be self-consistent with existing laws.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-new-law-deduction-process" tabindex="-1">I. The New-Law Deduction Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-new-law-deduction-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The New-Law Deduction Process&quot;">​</a></h2><p>New laws are not thought up on the spot; they have a strict deduction process:</p><ol><li><strong>Observe anomaly</strong>: in cultivation or engineering practice, observe a phenomenon the existing law network cannot explain;</li><li><strong>Propose hypothesis</strong>: based on the anomaly, propose the hypothesis &quot;some new law may exist&quot;;</li><li><strong>Simulate and verify</strong>: use the Deduction-Iteration System to simulate this new law&#39;s effects in virtual space;</li><li><strong>Self-consistency check</strong>: check whether the new law conflicts with existing laws;</li><li><strong>Small-scale pilot</strong>: actually run this new law in isolated space, observing effects;</li><li><strong>Network-wide rollout</strong>: after pilot succeeds, officially anchor it into the law network.</li></ol><p>The six-step process ensures new laws are not fantasy, but verified engineering results.</p><h2 id="ii-the-new-law-anchoring-technology" tabindex="-1">II. The New-Law Anchoring Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-new-law-anchoring-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The New-Law Anchoring Technology&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After deduction verification passes, the next step is anchoring. Anchoring&#39;s purpose is to let the new law stably exist in the law network, not drift, not degrade, not be overwritten by old laws.</p><p>Anchoring technology&#39;s core is the &quot;living anchor&quot;:</p><ul><li>In the star sector covered by the new law, deploy one or more Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm living anchors;</li><li>The living anchor&#39;s personal Dao deeply fuses with the new law; his very existence is the new law&#39;s physical anchor;</li><li>The anchor continuously calibrates the new law through the Alaya Network, preventing drift;</li><li>The anchor simultaneously monitors the new law&#39;s impact on surrounding old laws, adjusting in time.</li></ul><p>A new law without a living anchor is like a bridge without piers — written on paper, but cannot stand.</p><h2 id="iii-the-new-law-self-consistency-review" tabindex="-1">III. The New-Law Self-Consistency Review <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-new-law-self-consistency-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The New-Law Self-Consistency Review&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before a new law enters the library, it must pass self-consistency review:</p><ul><li><strong>Meta-law compatibility</strong>: the new law may not violate the six top-level axioms;</li><li><strong>Charter-level compatibility</strong>: the new law may not conflict with the Myriad-Rank Republican Charter;</li><li><strong>Existing law-network compatibility</strong>: the new law may not contradict existing concrete laws;</li><li><strong>Long-term stability</strong>: simulate after a billion years whether the new law is still stable;</li><li><strong>Side-effect assessment</strong>: after the new law is introduced, what side effects does it have on existing ecology, the cultivation system, and Myriad Ranks&#39; lives.</li></ul><p>Any one failing sends it back for re-deduction.</p><h2 id="iv-new-law-myriad-rank-participation" tabindex="-1">IV. New-Law Myriad-Rank Participation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-new-law-myriad-rank-participation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. New-Law Myriad-Rank Participation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>New-law introduction is not decided by one cultivator alone:</p><ul><li>Deduction results are publicized network-wide, accepting Myriad-Rank opinions;</li><li>New laws with large impact require Myriad-Rank Representatives&#39; Assembly vote;</li><li>During pilot, invite relevant races to participate in testing;</li><li>After anchoring, regular reviews adjust per Myriad-Rank feedback.</li></ul><p>This ensures new laws are not &quot;whatever the strong likes gets on,&quot; but &quot;whatever Myriad Ranks need gets on.&quot;</p><p>New-law deduction does not succeed every time. The Alaya Network records all rejected proposals — including logical holes in the deduction process, contradictions exposed in self-consistency review, and objections raised in Myriad-Rank hearings. These failure cases are as important as success cases: they tell later deductors &quot;why this road does not work,&quot; avoiding repeated pit-stepping. Some proposals look elegant on the surface, but conflict with some hidden dependency of the existing law network, and are stopped at review; some proposals are technically feasible, but in Myriad-Rank hearings are proven to burden some weak ethnic group, and are also sent back. New-law birth rate is deliberately kept low — in one cosmic eon, stably anchoring three to five truly important new laws is enough to support civilization&#39;s leap. Rather than abundance than shoddiness is the first precept of the law-weaving craft.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: new laws expand the law network&#39;s coverage, letting more cosmic patterns be utilized, reducing energy waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: new-law deduction and anchoring are throughout supervised by the Alaya Network, preventing anyone from using new laws to establish predatory advantage</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s &quot;new laws&quot; are changed by Gu Chensha&#39;s one sentence; Heng Yuan Zhou goes through deduction, pilot, publicity, vote</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: new laws&#39; publicity, vote, and testing whole process is open to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: new-law deduction methods, anchoring technology, and self-consistency standards are all publicized through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>New-law deduction and anchoring is one of Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators&#39; most central civilizational engineering projects. It lets the law network always grow new parts — not to make one person stronger, but to make the whole cosmos&#39;s civilizational infrastructure more and more complete.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/24-锚点能量传导路径.html">Entry 24 · Anchor Energy-Conduction Path</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor Structure and Hierarchy</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/27-锚点校准与维护.html">Entry 27 · Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{w as __pageData,g as default};
